---
/**
 * Port of `.divider` (style/layout.css:21-27).
 *
 * A hairline that sits flush with the bottom of whatever precedes it. It has no
 * horizontal padding on purpose: at 1160px wide it lines up with the *content*
 * column of every `.container` block (which is content-box — see base.css).
 */
---

<div class="divider"></div>

<style>
  .divider {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    position: relative;
    top: -1px;
  }
</style>
